<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Dear,<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">Thank you for your interest in the <strong>Publicly Funded In-Vitro Fertilization Program</strong>. </span></span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">T</span></span><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">he Ministry of Health has reviewed your application </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">(</span></span></span>{{{Case.CaseNumber}}}<span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">).</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-US">We are not able to complete the review of your Publicly Funded IVF Program application as the application information does not match the spousal information on your Medical Services Plan (MSP) account.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">As the funding amount is based on household income, the application details and required income documentation must match with the spousal information listed under your </span></span><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">MSP </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">account.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-US">If your family unit has changed, you must update your MSP account. You may update your account by visiting</span> <a href="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/health-drug-coverage/msp/bc-residents/managing-your-msp-account/adding-and-removing-dependents" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; color:blue; text-decoration:underline"><span lang="EN-US">https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/health-drug-coverage/msp/bc-residents/managing-your-msp-account/adding-and-removing-dependents</span></a><span lang="EN-CA">. If you have questions regarding your MSP account, please contact Health Insurance BC by visiting </span><a href="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/health-drug-coverage/msp/bc-residents-contact-us" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; color:blue; text-decoration:underline">https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/health-drug-coverage/msp/bc-residents-contact-us</a><span lang="EN-CA">. Please note that any necessary MSP account updates must be completed within 45 days of the date of this letter for your Publicly Funded IVF Program application to be reconsidered by the Ministry.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">Please do not respond directly to this notice. The Ministry will continue reviewing your Publicly Funded IVF Program application once your MSP account is updated. You are encouraged to remain in contact with your fertility clinic regarding your application status.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA">Sincerely,</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<strong><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-US">Publicly Funded IVF Program</span></span></span></strong><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:9.0pt">Beneficiary and Diagnostic Services Branch |LNBSD| Ministry of Health</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt">Address: 1515 Blanshard St, Victoria, BC V8W 1P3</span></span></span><br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">Website: </span></span><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><a href="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/accessing-health-care/publicly-funded-ivf-program" style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; color:blue; text-decoration:underline" title="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/accessing-health-care/publicly-funded-ivf-program"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/health/accessing-health-care/publicly-funded-ivf-program</span></span></a></span></span><br />
<br />
<b><i><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:8.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="color:#a20000">Warning:</span></span></span></i></b><i><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:8.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span style="color:#a20000"> This email is intended only for the use of the individual or organization to whom it is addressed. It may contain information that is privileged or confidential. Any distribution, disclosure, copying, or other use by anyone else is strictly prohibited. If you have received this in error, please telephone or e-mail the sender immediately and delete the message</span></span></span></i></span></body>
</html>